Z||000008||pollock||06-08-2000||02:10 PM||||glad y'all enjoyed that.<P>Now here's a true story that i thought was hilarious, but maybe you had to be there:<P>I worked at Autozone for a little while during college. We had a rack of air fresheners on the register counter, and one of them said "JESUS" on it and had a picture of him.  <BR>I was ringing up an old dude's purchase one night, when he saw the Jesus freshener and and smiled.  Here is the ensuing conversation between us:<BR>O.D.:  Hey, look at that.  (inquisitively)I wonder what it smell like?<BR>Me:  I don't know.  I haven't smelled one.  <BR>[it didn't say on the package either]<BR>O.D.: (placing it on the counter) Well, hope it don't stank.  <BR>Me:  Probably won't.<BR>O.D.:  (with a big grin)  Well, if it do, i guess i was meant to smell somethin' stanky!<P>Made my night. <BR>||||reg||1
