Z||000036||Pontiaddict||06-10-2000||09:43 PM||||IMPORTANT NOTICE:<BR>If you want to swap your notchback tree for the smoother looking lines of the triangular fasback tree you cannot use the notchback string! You MUST use the fastback string. The  3oz weight difference between the two can break the notchback string with disasterous consiquences. Fortunately for those who can't  find one of the discontinued fastback strings, I sell conversion strings that are produced with the original tooling. <BR>For more information, or to purchase the conversion string among many other pine tree air freshener accesories, visit my website site at <A HREF="http://www.pinetreeairfreshnerconversions.net/fiero" TARGET=_blank>www.pinetreeairfreshnerconversions.net/fiero</A> ||||reg||4
