Z||000094||bHooper||11-09-2000||09:28 AM||||ok, already.  I didn't want to spoil the surprise, but Carl is just to anxiouse!  So here goes:<P>The special xmas pine tree air fresheners will be available with the following features:<P>Color: Red, Green, Synth Gold, Silver, White, Blue and Yellow  (burgundy is not a option)<P>They will be in a translucent form, as not to obscure the field of vision.<P>No bag needed.<P>Hangers are made of a special custom bungy cord material (string and elastic are not available)<P>They will come in 6 or 12 packs of assorted colors.  18 packs will be aluminum only.<P>Price for a 6 pack... $ 7.37<BR>Price for a 12 pack.. $ 13.99<P>Buy in bulk!  They make a great stocking stuffer!<P>------------------<BR>hoop<BR>Red '86 GT<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/alien.gif"> ||||reg||1
